Why This Is Asked
- Tests end-to-end Azure data engineering: ingestion, governance, lineage, schema drift, and disaster recovery.

Key Concepts
- Delta Lake on ADLS Gen2, Delta Live Tables, Azure Schema Registry, Purview, Event Hubs, SFTP ingestion, cross-region DR, backfill with time travel, data quality gates.

Code Example
